# Read by Cloudflare when uploading Workers static assets. OpenNext copies
# public/ into .open-next/assets/, so this file travels with it.
#
# DuckDB-WASM's two engine binaries are 39.4 MB and 34.2 MB, over Cloudflare's
# 25 MiB per-file limit (Free and Paid alike), so the deploy would be rejected
# outright with them in the manifest. They are served from R2 on this same
# origin instead — see app/duckdb/[file]/route.ts and wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Everything else under public/duckdb/ (the two ~800 KB worker scripts) is well
# under the limit and still ships as a normal static asset.
duckdb/duckdb-mvp.wasm
duckdb/duckdb-eh.wasm
